# REST Client examples for the Supply Chain Risk Scorer API
#
# Purpose:
#   This file is the interim verification mechanism in lieu of a UI during
#   Phase 0 of the backend build-out. It lets reviewers and future sub-devins
#   exercise the routes with no frontend in place.
#
# How to use:
#   - VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) and
#     click "Send Request" above any `###`-delimited block.
#   - Shell: `curl` equivalents are noted in comments for each block.
#
# Phase 1 sub-devins: when you add a new route under `web/app/api/**`,
# append a new `###` block to this file with a representative GET example.
# Keep one canonical example per route so reviewers have a single place
# to test the full surface.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### A8 — health probe
# curl: curl -sS "$BASE/api/health" | jq .
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### A7 — global counts (npm)
# curl: curl -sS "$BASE/api/stats/counts?ecosystem=npm" | jq .
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/counts?ecosystem=npm
Accept: application/json

### A1 — package search
# curl: curl -sS "$BASE/api/packages/search?q=react&limit=10&ecosystem=npm" | jq .
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/search?q=react&limit=10&ecosystem=npm
Accept: application/json

### A2 — single package + latest-version enrichment
# curl: curl -sS "$BASE/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d?ecosystem=npm" | jq .
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d?ecosystem=npm
Accept: application/json

### R1 — versions of a package (Q1)
# curl: curl -sS "$BASE/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d/versions?limit=50&offset=0&ecosystem=npm" | jq .
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d/versions?limit=50&offset=0&ecosystem=npm
Accept: application/json

### A3 — maintainers of a package (deduped by username)
# curl: curl -sS "$BASE/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d/maintainers?limit=100&offset=0&ecosystem=npm" | jq .
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d/maintainers?limit=100&offset=0&ecosystem=npm
Accept: application/json

### A4 — direct dependencies of a package's latest version
# curl: curl -sS "$BASE/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d/dependencies?depKind=all&limit=100&offset=0&ecosystem=npm" | jq .
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d/dependencies?depKind=all&limit=100&offset=0&ecosystem=npm
Accept: application/json

### A5 — packages that directly depend on this package
# curl: curl -sS "$BASE/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d/dependents?limit=100&offset=0&ecosystem=npm" | jq .
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/0063402a-1335-5d56-b371-0ac3026e129d/dependents?limit=100&offset=0&ecosystem=npm
Accept: application/json

### R9 — package versions with no source repository (Q9)
# curl: curl -sS "$BASE/api/packages/no-repo?limit=100&offset=0&ecosystem=npm" | jq .
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/no-repo?limit=100&offset=0&ecosystem=npm
Accept: application/json
